	.faq-title { padding: 40px; background: #FFFFFF; }

    .faq-content {background: #ffffff;}
	.faq-content ol, .faq-content ul{color: #878787; }
	.faq-content ol, .faq-content ul {font-size: 18px; padding-left: 20px;}
	.faq-content ol li, .faq-content ul li {margin-bottom:0; line-height: 27px;}
	.art-cta a{font-weight: 600;}
	.faq-content {padding: 0 40px 40px;}
   .faq-content p, .faq-content ul, .faq-content ol {margin-bottom: 0 !important;}

	

</style>

<div class="lp-faq-section top-96">
	<div class="section-leading-center">
	<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
	</div>




<div class="faq-container">
<div class="">
<div class="container">

<div id="accordion" data-mage-init='{
        "accordion":{
            "active": [0],
            "collapsible": true,
            "openedState": "active",
            "multipleCollapsible": false,
            "animate":{"duration":"400" } 
                  
        }}'>


<div class="faq-section">



<div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-title" data-role="collapsible" >
        <div data-role="trigger" class="faq-head">
            <h4>What printing options do you offer for custom clothing packaging?</h4>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-content" data-role="content">
    
<p>We recommend offset printing for garment boxes to ensure any text is printed in high quality and is easily readable for consumers. Offset printing is also recommended for bulk orders because it is:
</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li>	Cost effective - the more you print, the lower the price per unit	</li>
<li>	Time efficient - offset printing can print large quantities at a faster rate	</li>
<li>	High quality - offset printing offers exceptional color fidelity that is easier to maintain	</li>
		</ul>

	<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Digital printing is also an option and provides cost effective results for smaller orders. </p>
		<p>&nbsp;</p>



    </div>
</div>

<div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-title" data-role="collapsible">
        <div data-role="trigger" class="faq-head">
            <h4>What is the turnaround time for custom apparel packaging?</h4>
        </div>
    </div>
<div class="faq-content" data-role="content">
<p>
	The average turnaround time is between 25-28 days. However, this time may vary depending on:

</p>
	<p>&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li>	Material options	</li>
<li>	Order Quantities	</li>
<li>	Shipping routes	</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>

<div class="faq-item">
    <div class="faq-title" data-role="collapsible">
        <div data-role="trigger" class="faq-head">
            <h4>What is the minimum order quantity for pharmaceutical packaging?  </h4>
        </div>
    </div>
      <div class="faq-content" data-role="content">
    
<p>The minimum order quantity will vary depending on the packaging type and material you choose.   </p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>For folding carton boxes and bags the minimum order quantity stands at 500 units.   </p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>For corrugated and rigid boxes the minimum order quantity  is 1000 units.   </p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Make sure to check in with your dedicated product specialist for MOQs tailored to your project.   </p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
	
		  
 </div>
</div>
</div>


</div> <!-- According END -->

</div>
</div>
</div>


</div><!-- Last Div --></div>


